**Definition (`tagStep`).** The state transformer tag step performs one stage of the finite numerical computation encoded in its state.

**Definition (`tagCode`).** The coding function tag code assigns its finite list, expression, pair, or tagged value a natural-number index by pairing and list coding.

**Definition (`tagOfBits`).** The set bits of an index are decoded as a finite list and nested as tags around a terminal value.

